EmailMercuryFishBody=Scientists in New Brunswick, Canada today announced the findings of a ten year study into heavy metal contamination of fish stocks. The findings were ‘seriously alarming’ said Dr. Jules Bortlien, but ‘ultimately not that relevant since there are no more tuna.
